# Search Policy

Follow `docs/SEARCH_POLICY.md`.

## Must search before acting when

- Tool/platform capability may have changed (Cursor, Codex, MCP, Playwright)
- Library API, config, or version behavior is uncertain
- AI provider pricing, limits, or auth changed
- Platform publish rules involved
- User asks for latest / official behavior

## Process

1. Prefer official docs → changelog → official GitHub
2. Log in `docs/RESEARCH_NOTES.md` with date and uncertainty
3. Encode actionable findings into repo docs

## If search unavailable

Record `TOOL_UNAVAILABLE_WEB_SEARCH` in round report; ask user or use Context7.

Do not fabricate API versions, prices, or platform rules.
